                "id": "q-enc-0002",
                "kind": "flattened_list",
                "target": "ServerSideEncryptionConfiguration.Rules",
                "summary": "The rules repeat as sibling Rule elements directly under the ServerSideEncryptionConfiguration root; a Rules wrapper element would make every SDK read zero rules.",
